      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's good, really hits hard. but i want to make sure we're being totally accurate. some people always try to argue that coal provides 'reliable energy' or helps the economy, but those are just excuses to keep the damage going, right? can you add a section that shuts down those arguments and explains why their 'economic' reasoning is basically just a lie to protect their profits?",
